    "superseded": "SP-7 v1 (HYPOTHESIS_LEDGER.md \u00a7P7-24): 'at alpha = q/m the expected promotions are <= 0.1 per catalogue, so <= 3 across 30. PASS: promotions at or below that rate, with the count consistent with binomial.' The cap of 3 is E[X] = N*q, the MEAN, not a bound.",
